#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:1 073a348ad5614bcdb2b7d380ed965fb3
msgid "Walk-forward optimization"
msgstr "Walk-forward 优化"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:3 10e8734da6ab4d708c05cd5acda21c46
msgid ""
"`Backtest.optimize()` picks the best parameter combination over the "
"*entire* dataset — and reports its in-sample performance. This is the "
"classic recipe for fitting noise. The \"best Sharpe 2.4\" you see almost "
"never holds up live."
msgstr ""
"`Backtest.optimize()` 在*整个*数据集上挑选最佳参数组合 —— 然后汇报样本内表现。"
"这是拟合噪声的经典配方。看到的「最优 Sharpe 2.4」实盘几乎从不成立。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:8 47bb4890fd3c442fa9132032f3ee6439
msgid ""
"`Backtest.walk_forward_optimize()` runs the same grid search inside "
"rolling windows and reports performance on data the strategy was never "
"tuned on:"
msgstr ""
"`Backtest.walk_forward_optimize()` 在滚动窗口内做同样的网格搜索，"
"在策略从未调过参的数据上汇报表现："

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:20 89062e85e6124e63aeb3bf4639e1d98a
msgid ""
"For every window pair, QTrade picks the best params on the train slice "
"and evaluates them on the immediately following test slice. The aggregate"
" of the test slices is your honest, out-of-sample (OoS) estimate of how "
"the strategy actually performs."
msgstr ""
"每个窗口对里，QTrade 在训练片段挑选最佳参数，并在紧接的测试片段上评估。"
"测试片段的聚合结果是策略真实表现的诚实样本外（OoS）估计。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:25 894beb82172a4992a9e076906ee55d40
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:39 cc25375a4c684e64965caf4deea3522d
msgid "Required:"
msgstr "必填："

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:41 c5ceb8cc460547de9982b05a8ebec200
msgid "**`train_window`**: bars per training slice."
msgstr "**`train_window`**：每个训练片段的 bar 数。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:42 7e4bc2e57c4f4f24a61b84384dadb1d6
msgid ""
"**`test_window`**: bars per test slice (immediately follows the train "
"slice)."
msgstr ""
"**`test_window`**：每个测试片段的 bar 数（紧跟训练片段之后）。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:43 b3def600d1c646709208a767bf253f22
msgid ""
"**`maximize`**: name of the metric from `calculate_stats()` to maximize "
"within each train slice. Common choices: `Sharpe Ratio`, `Total Return "
"[%]`, `Calmar Ratio`. See the [stats glossary](stats_glossary.md) for "
"what each means."
msgstr ""
"**`maximize`**：在每个训练片段内最大化的 `calculate_stats()` 指标名。"
"常见选择：`Sharpe Ratio`、`Total Return [%]`、`Calmar Ratio`。"
"含义详见 [统计指标词汇表](stats_glossary.md)。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:47 07ed5199fdc44b24bdc12c10be184a48
msgid ""
"**`**params_grid`**: same syntax as `optimize()` — keyword arguments "
"whose values are iterables of candidates."
msgstr ""
"**`**params_grid`**：和 `optimize()` 同语法 —— 关键字参数，值是候选项的可迭代对象。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:50 7a09aaeaff2f410f8618e5dc0aec1ac3
msgid "Optional:"
msgstr "可选："

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:52 7ce19bbed8364437a00c7d2cba9a25cb
msgid ""
"**`step`**: how many bars to advance between consecutive train starts. "
"Defaults to `test_window` (non-overlapping test windows). Smaller values "
"give overlapping (correlated) test windows; larger values leave gaps."
msgstr ""
"**`step`**：相邻训练起点之间推进多少 bar。默认 `test_window`（测试窗口不重叠）。"
"更小值产生重叠（相关）的测试窗口；更大值留下空隙。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:56 8394e356843f4e7c8f7abfc716fe1d24
msgid ""
"**`constraint`**: filter `lambda p: bool` applied to each parameter dict "
"before evaluating. Use this to skip nonsensical combinations (e.g. fast "
"SMA window > slow SMA window)."
msgstr ""
"**`constraint`**：评估前应用到每个参数字典的过滤器（`lambda p: bool`）。"
"用于跳过无意义组合（如快线 SMA 窗口 > 慢线窗口）。"

#: ../guide/walk_forward.md:60 a18f6295e057490ea1bf812687d9e759
